{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Golf King</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your club, conquer the world!<br><strong>Golf King</strong> combines <strong>realistic golf physics</strong> with <strong>limitless creative gameplay</strong>. Whether you\u2019re a competitive pro or a casual player looking for fun, you\u2019ll find your own golf joy here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26f3 <strong>Three Modes, Endless Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcc\ufe0f\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Course Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Courses</strong> \u2014 Over <strong>100+ course combinations</strong>, every round feels brand new.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ink-Painting World</strong> \u2014 Experience golf in the unique <strong>Chinese landscape \u201cA Thousand Miles of Rivers and Mountains.\u201d</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf89 <strong>Entertainment Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Landing Challenge</strong> \u2014 Classic <strong>TopGolf-style precision play</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cyber City Battle</strong> \u2014 Tee off from neon rooftops in a futuristic metropolis.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cliffside Green Attack</strong> \u2014 Hit targets in mystical floating cliffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bowling Showdown</strong> \u2014 Golf meets bowling\u2014strike with your putter!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blackjack 21</strong> \u2014 A creative mix of golf and cards, outwit AI rivals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Victory Island</strong> \u2014 An endless putting challenge on an ever-expanding island.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfcc\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f <strong>Practice Mode</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Driving Range</strong> \u2014 Pure and realistic training.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sakura Range</strong> \u2014 Strike gongs amid cherry blossoms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sakura Pro</strong> \u2014 Hit glowing rings to awaken a mighty dragon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tomorrowland Range</strong> \u2014 Face hordes of zombies with golf balls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing Master</strong> \u2014 Battle sharks on the open sea with golf shots!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic physics</strong>: Every swing tests your skill and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative crossover gameplay</strong>: Mixing golf with art, sci-fi, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For everyone</strong>: Compete, relax, or train\u2014your choice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 In <strong>Golf King</strong>, rise and become the true master of the course!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018850?t=1758849977","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018850?t=1758849977","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018850/fdcb95f04dc508df8c134019c3b7877477735239/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758849977","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018850/fdcb95f04dc508df8c134019c3b7877477735239/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758849977","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"d